{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Description</strong>: Fight your way through each level to wake from this Nightmare or remain trapped in the dream. Can you escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong>: In Simple Nightmares: Strategic Shooter, expect the unexpected. Each meticulously crafted scene ensures unpredictable and exhilarating enemy encounters. Light puzzle elements enhance interaction with the environment.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538420/extras/SimpleNightmareGIF2_-_Made_with_Clipchamp.gif?t=1745195213\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmosphere and Challenge</strong>: I strive to build a suspenseful and unpredictable atmosphere, drawing from popular science fiction to create enemies that stealthily approach players, catching them off guard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong>: Simple controls, best suited for keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic environments with randomized elements that keep gameplay fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suspenseful atmosphere blended with action.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538420?t=1745195213","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538420?t=1745195213","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538420/bde98ea34ada511c8dfcee7b8f959e5fa5dbbcea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745195213","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538420/bde98ea34ada511c8dfcee7b8f959e5fa5dbbcea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745195213","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Description</strong>: Fight your way through each leve